WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
All over the country,

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.480
statues of confederate generals

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.850
and other controversial historical figures

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.740
are being removed.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.860
You've heard about this.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.870
They're being removed,

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.390
or sometimes they're being torn down.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.250
Now, most people are really glad

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.120
to finally see some of these statues gone.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.360
But not everybody's onboard.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.690
One of those people

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:24.310
is joining me via satellite.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:28.160
Please welcome the Bob's Big Boy statue.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.050
Ah, hey, hi, Conan.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.060
Hello.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.210
[Conan] Hey, well, thank
you so much for being here.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.930
First off, how do I address you?

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.192
Is it Bob, or do I call you Big Boy?

00:00:38.192 --> 00:00:40.200
(laughs) Yeah, well,
that's pretty confusing.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.060
So Bob is my dad, and I'm his big boy.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.160
So, but you know what?

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.480
Just call me Kevin.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.563
It's less awkward.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.990
Okay, great.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.580
So Kevin,

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.413
how do you feel

00:00:52.413 --> 00:00:54.380
about all of these
statues being taken down?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.800
I'm terrified.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.350
I've been sleeping with one eye open.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.160
I may look like I'm smiling,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.030
but inside I am crapping my overalls!

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:05.060
Well, oh, you know, you
shouldn't be scared.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.700
I don't think you have
anything to worry about, Kevin.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.830
You're just a fast food mascot.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.270
Nothing to worry about?

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.103
Oh, trust me.

00:01:12.103 --> 00:01:13.520
I know where this is going!

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.650
First, they come for the Confederates

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.720
then it's the slave owners.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.660
Then it's probably gonna
be the lawn gnomes,

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:21.730
and then pretty soon

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.880
all of us fast food guys
are on the guillotine!

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.010
That's why I've been packin' heat, Conan!

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.060
Okay, no, no, no.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.040
You shouldn't be packing heat.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:30.873
Don't do that.

00:01:30.873 --> 00:01:32.400
I'm armed to the teeth, Conan!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.250
I'm ready to pop off!

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.770
I've got a walk-in gun closet!

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:37.770
Alright, okay, no.

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:38.603
[Kevin] I do!

00:01:38.603 --> 00:01:39.760
I've got a desert eagle-
No, no.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.367
[Kevin] hiding under the
pickles in this burger!

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.200
I do!
[Conan] Okay!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.033
No, no, stop!

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:46.480
My pockets are stuffed with grenades!

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.450
Calm, down!

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.100
No, no, no, this whole
movement isn't about statues,

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:53.740
but about what kind of
people the statues represent!

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:56.060
I mean it's not like
you've done anything wrong.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.610
Oh, no, Conan.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:00.670
I've done terrible things.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:01.600
Really?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.820
Like what?

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.490
Off the record?

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.800
Well, no, this is a live TV show.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.120
Thank you.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.150
Where do I start?

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:12.050
Tax evasion, some light credit card fraud,

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.320
a ton of DUIs!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.469
Okay, well, that's not good.

00:02:15.469 --> 00:02:16.302
That's pretty bad,

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.850
but it's not as bad as some of the things

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.683
these statues have done.

00:02:18.683 --> 00:02:20.290
Well, but I'm just getting started.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.020
Selling human organs on the dark web,

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.170
cock fighting, and I mean both kinds.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:29.240
I told Harvey Weinstein
to use that walker.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.980
I wrote that song "Despacito"!

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.630
You wrote "Despacito"?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:34.520
I did!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.130
It was a moment of weakness!

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.640
I shouldn't have written
it let alone released it!

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:40.520
Oh god, okay.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.400
You know what?

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.390
I'm, no, I'm not letting you off the hook.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.420
I do hope someone tears you down then.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:48.890
Well if they try,
they're gonna be ordering

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.630
a hot bullet combo meal to go!

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.070
I'm loco, Conan!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.180
I'm crazy!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.663
I will take you out!

00:02:55.663 --> 00:02:57.140
(rumbling)

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.220
Oh! Oh!

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.053
Oh no!

00:02:59.053 --> 00:02:59.886
No, they're here!

00:02:59.886 --> 00:03:00.719
Oh, I knew it!

00:03:00.719 --> 00:03:02.163
I'm going down, Conan!

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.170
Take him away guys.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.540
So long, Kevin, and I won't
be sorry to see you go.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.300
Delete my browser history,

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.459
and remember, we're open
for curbside pick up!

00:03:12.459 --> 00:03:13.950
(Kevin's scream fades out)
(statue crashing)

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.990
Loyal to those burgers to the very end.

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:17.070
You gotta admire him.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.150
Are you dead yet, Kevin?
(hammers banging)

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.140
[Kevin] Not yet.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.180
They're pounding on me with glee!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.389
They're going right for my eyes!

00:03:24.389 --> 00:03:25.222
(statue crashing)

00:03:25.222 --> 00:03:27.750
Is your body intact or
has that been smashed?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.210
[Kevin] The body has been smashed!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:31.440
People are crawling inside of me!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.180
It's horrible!

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.210
Anyway, that was Bob's Big Boy,

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.880
a.k.a. Kevin.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.133
He's been torn down.

